n:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"r9u_j0z_xtb_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"生子三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或未核定指代；未由熟知世系補造人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"世父","kind":"person","person_id":"r9u_j0z_xtb_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"世父","kind":"person","person_id":"r9u_j0z_xtb_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"仲","kind":"person","person_id":"r9u_j0z_xtb_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"戎王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或未核定指代；未由熟知世系補造人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"r9u_j0z_xtb_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m008-0071","start":71,"end":75,"surface":"太子襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p009","text":"襄公元年，以女弟繆嬴為豐王妻。襄公二年，戎圍犬丘，世父擊之，為戎人所虜。歲餘，復歸世父。七年春，周幽王用褒姒廢太子，立褒姒子為適，數欺諸侯，諸侯叛之。西戎犬戎與申侯伐周，殺幽王酈山下。而秦襄公將兵救周，戰甚力，有功。周避犬戎難，東徙雒邑，襄公以兵送周平王。平王封襄公為諸侯，賜之岐以西之地。曰：「戎無道，侵奪我岐、豐之地，秦能攻逐戎，即有其地。」與誓，封爵之。襄公於是始國，與諸侯通使聘享之禮，乃用騮駒、黃牛、羝羊各三，祠上帝西畤。十二年，伐戎而至岐，卒。生文公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"襄公","